Well I've developed a little strategy to utilize the wraith corpses in
the Valley of the Dead. Basically, you try to make your way through the
valley without killing everything, but waking everything. Then you go
to the downstairs and fight from there. Any time a wraith comes, take
them downstairs and kill them, where there is a higher chance of them
generating a corpse. I've gotten ten levels or so this way.



